<title>USA: Dow off more than 50 points.</title>
<headline>Dow off more than 50 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street fell sharply  in early trading on Wednesday, weighed down by weakness in key high-technology companies that warned of weak quarterly results.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrials was off  50.67 points at 7,710.11, which activated the New York Stock Exchange's limits on program trading.</p>
